  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Christmas fruit kabobs shine like little edible ornaments, stacking strawberries, pineapple, green grapes, and mandarin slices into bright, festive skewers. Add marshmallow stars and fresh mint for a cheerful touch, then glaze everything with creamy vanilla yogurt mixed with honey and a squeeze of lime for sweet, tangy sparkle. Perfect for parties, tree trimming, or snack breaks while wrapping gifts, christmas fruit kabobs are easy to assemble and impossible not to smile at with every colorful bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-christmas-fruit-kabobs\">Why You’ll Love This Christmas fruit kabobs</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-christmas-fruit-kabobs\">How to Make Christmas Fruit Kabobs</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-christmas-fruit-kabobs\">Pro Tips for Making Christmas Fruit Kabobs</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-christmas-fruit-kabobs\">How to Serve this Christmas fruit kabobs</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-christmas-fruit-kabobs\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Christmas fruit kabobs</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>They’re a fun and festive way to enjoy fruit during the holidays.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for kids and adults alike, making them a hit at any gathering.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to customize with your favorite seasonal fruits.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy and refreshing, balancing out all those holiday treats.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to assemble, leaving you more time to enjoy the festivities!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-9273\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"9273\" data-servings=\"6\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"533\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Festive-Christmas-Fruit-Kabobs.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Colorful Christmas fruit kabobs on a wooden platter with strawberries, grapes, pineapple, melon, and marshmallows.\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Festive-Christmas-Fruit-Kabobs.webp 1200w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Festive-Christmas-Fruit-Kabobs-300x169.webp 300w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Festive-Christmas-Fruit-Kabobs-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Festive-Christmas-Fruit-Kabobs-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Festive-Christmas-Fruit-Kabobs-480x270.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">Christmas fruit kabobs</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div clas